# The nxkit release the app bundles as its build engine "nxkit (Beta)" (Contents/Resources/nxbuild/, nxb and nxkit-host, LNPANDY/NX2Apple#1460).
# build-mac-app.yml and tools/try-local run `frontend/tools/nxbuild.py fetch`: download the zip and the release's SHA256SUMS, check the zip's SHA-256
# against the line below, unpack nxb and nxkit-host, check both against MANIFEST.json and SHA256SUMS, and sign them ad hoc. The launcher updates
# nxkit itself from newer signed releases (NxkitUpdate.swift), this pair is the baseline and the fallback. `frontend/tools/nxbuild.py bump <version>`
# writes a new version with its digest from the release's SHA256SUMS. A sha256 of PLACEHOLDER bundles nothing.
version	0.10.2
sha256	8535c8dd07951a0f1976ba9123ead88f3633ffaf20939da5fabb850c9ce156e1
url	https://github.com/v0lumehi/nxkit/releases/download/v{version}/nxb-v{version}-macos-arm64.zip
